############################################################################
# Retina cell-type subclustering with contamination cleaning, and
# nr2f2 / nr2f2b / nr2f5 expression per subcluster (Anableps)
#
# Groups:  AC  = amacrine (GABAergic + non-GABAergic)
#          MGC = Muller glia 1 + 2
#          BC  = bipolar cells
#          HC  = horizontal cells
#          RGC = RGC 1 + 2
#
# Pipeline
#   1. subset each group, reprocess from scratch (photoreceptor genes kept out
#      of the variable features), PCA
#   2. subcluster at low resolution (capped number of clusters)
#   3. score contamination (Muller / RPE / photoreceptor / oligodendrocyte /
#      cycling) per cell
#   4. remove contaminated cells, reprocess and recluster
#   5. nr2f2, nr2f2b and nr2f5 together: % of cells expressing each gene and
#      each combination, per cell type and per subcluster; dot plot
#   6. save one cleaned object per cell type
#
# Gene names in the object: NR2F2 (= nr2f2b, assumption) | NR2F2.1 (= nr2f2, assumption) | nr2f5
# Notes
#   * Labels are read from Idents(obj); check the printout in section 0.
#   * Subcluster numbers can shift slightly if you change seeds or Seurat
#     versions, so re-check the numbers in the figures against your data.
############################################################################

# ---- 0. Setup ---------------------------------------------------------------
